      "lines": [
        "$\\frac{3}{8}\\cdot\\frac{4}{15}=\\frac{3\\cdot4}{8\\cdot15}=\\frac{1}{2\\cdot5}=\\frac{1}{10}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "**分数乘法满足交换律和结合律.**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "运用分数乘法也可以解用自然数乘法解的问题."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "例4. 一公斤面粉值$\\frac{11}{25}$卢布，$\\frac{3}{4}$公斤面粉值多少卢布？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "解这样自然数或者小数的应用题，我们过去是用乘法.",
        "现在我们也用乘法解这道题：",
        "$\\frac{11}{25}\\cdot\\frac{3}{4}=\\frac{33}{100}$（卢布）."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "结果，$\\frac{3}{4}$公斤面粉值$\\frac{33}{100}$卢布，也就是33戈比. 让我们来验算",
        "所得答案. 价格用戈比表示：",
        "$\\frac{11}{25}$卢布$=44$戈比."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "这就是$\\frac{1}{4}$公斤面粉的价格是11戈比$(44:4=11)$，$\\frac{3}{4}$公斤面粉",
        "的价格是33戈比$(11\\cdot3=33)$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "例5. 一块地的面积是8公顷. 求这块地的$\\frac{3}{4}$的面积."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "这块地的$\\frac{1}{4}$的面积等于$8:4=2$（公顷），而$\\frac{3}{4}$的面积等于",
        "$2\\cdot3=6$（公顷）. 如果把8乘以$\\frac{3}{4}$也可以得出同样的答案，即",
        "$8\\cdot\\frac{3}{4}=6$（公顷）. 就是说，为了求某数的$\\frac{3}{4}$，应当用$\\frac{3}{4}$乘这",
        "个数."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
